* AD8092 Non-Inverting Amplifier, Gain = +5 V/V, +/-5 V Supplies
* Vin = 100 mV amplitude sine @ 1 MHz, RL = 1 kohm to ground
*
* ---- Model library (genuine ADI AD8092 macromodel) ----
.include AD8092.cir
* Pin order of the ADI AD8092 macromodel: +IN  -IN  V+  V-  OUT

*---------------- Supplies ----------------
VCC VCC 0 DC 5
VEE VEE 0 DC -5

*---------------- Input source -------------
* 100 mV amplitude (200 mV pk-pk) sine at 1 MHz, AC 1 for .AC analysis
VIN IN 0 DC 0 AC 1 SINE(0 100m 1MEG 0 0 0)
RS IN 0 1G          ; DC path for source node (harmless high value)

*---------------- Amplifier ----------------
XU1 IN FB VCC VEE OUT AD8092

* Non-inverting gain:  1 + RF/RG = 1 + 4k/1k = 5 V/V  (13.98 dB)
RG FB 0 1k
RF OUT FB 4k

*---------------- Load --------------------
RL OUT 0 1k

*---------------- Analyses ----------------
.tran 0 5u 0 200p
.ac dec 200 10k 500MEG

.options plotwinsize=0 numdgt=7
.end
